<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="饺子的神奇小窝项目总览，支持跨设备访问与搜索引擎收录。" />
  <title>仪表盘 - 饺子的神奇小窝</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/a2e0b9e4f8.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg">
  <%- include('partials/header', { user: user }) %>

  <main class="content">
    <%- include('partials/hero') %>
    <form class="search" action="/dashboard" method="get" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 32px auto;">
      <input type="search" name="q" value="<%= query %>" placeholder="搜索项目、标签..." />
      <button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-search"></i></button>
    </form>
    <section class="cruise-features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544551763-46a013bb70d5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" alt="邮轮体验">
        <h3>海上奇遇</h3>
        <p>探索无尽海洋，享受豪华邮轮之旅。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" alt="目的地">
        <h3>全球目的地</h3>
        <p>从加勒比海到地中海，世界各地等你探索。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551882547-ff40c63fe5fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" alt="娱乐活动">
        <h3>精彩活动</h3>
        <p>从水上乐园到现场表演，应有尽有。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="cards" id="cards">
      <% if (projects.length === 0) { %>
        <article class="card-item empty">暂无项目，管理员请先创建一个。</article>
      <% } %>
      <% projects.forEach((p) => { %>
        <%- include('partials/card', { p: p, user: user }) %>
      <% }); %>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
